      "writtenOn": "2025-10-08T19:48:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e In addition to flushing the client-owned surface when its temporary image is drawn, we also have to flush any surface that has pending work that depends on the previous state of the surface.\n\nDoes this mean the GM code needs updating to flush the main canvas? Or is this a bigger change where graphite internally does that?",
      "parentUuid": "b2ec0f57_ad103294",
      "revId": "a187f9a795541be322b6202736e7ca71dfa67265",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
